    "content": "Materials: Whiteboard, number pairs. How to do it: 1) Write a subtraction pair: 500 – 275. 2) Ask: 'Look at ones place: 0 – 5. Do we need to borrow?' (Yes) 3) Ask: 'Look at tens place after borrowing from hundreds: 10 – 7. Do we need to borrow again?' (No, 10 > 7) 4) Repeat with: 600 – 345 (ones: 0–5, borrow; tens: 10–4, no further borrow), 800 – 488 (ones: 0–8, borrow; tens after lending: 9–8, no further borrow). 5) Students hold up thumbs up (borrow) or thumbs down (no borrow) for each place.",
